{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05、S06等处压缩了心理因果和细微转折，例如不服气如何因疲惫而淡去、他这次为何不再用受过的气压住想念，X交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句有明确的视觉锚点，感受文字又通过大小层级和音乐时点分批出现，观众更容易一边听音乐一边抓住叙事与情绪的对应关系；尤其是情绪从昂扬、柔软、刺痛到疲惫、重新站稳的变化，具体而有层次。X的优势是叙事心理交代更充分，但大量感受词同时铺开，部分段落容易形成信息堆积；综合实际观看体验，Y更容易让普通观众既跟上故事，又感受到音乐中的细微变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "845cd791-5a5d-4d26-a2fb-181cb680cd97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T184447717105Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:45:48.120623+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7f0ec19044c890ab33cecf0a8ac1e18623ce46f148e30853f7e72f2d601d3647", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt